The test failed because after the foreach loop over people, the code calls _libraryManager.GetItemList with an InternalItemsQuery and then calls Chunk on the result. The test did not set up GetItemList, so it returned null, causing the exception.

I will fix the test by setting up GetItemList to return an empty list to avoid the null reference.

I will resubmit the test with this fix.

